5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello everyone. I... I hope we can choose a project that truly helps the people doing the work. I would like to look into the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here. Let's make this fun! I want to see who's actually available to help, so I'll check in-house developer availability and the staffing of the coordination group.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To avoid the usual optimism that leads to disaster, I shall examine the network coverage at customer plants and the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we must ensure the financial foundation is secure before we commit. I will examine the capital budget and software allowance, as well as the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm really happy to be part of this! I want to make sure we don't make the same mistakes twice, so I'll check the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we have a good variety of things to check. I'll just wait to see what everyone finds. I hope the data shows where the real struggles are.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, don't be so gloomy! I'm sure we'll find something exciting. I think we've covered all the bases, so I'm ready to see what the secrets are. Let's get to it!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, ""secrets"" is a bit dramatic, but I appreciate the energy. I believe our current selection of records is sufficient to expose the gaps between our promises and reality. I am ready.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We have a balanced set of investigations. I will focus on the financial implications to ensure we do not overlook the long-term costs. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's all do our best to pick a project that's actually going to work for everyone! See you in the next round!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
