17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I believe we have reached a consensus on our research. There is no need for further chatter. I am ready to see if the data is as cooperative as we are.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
