19,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. We have defined our parameters and assigned our roles. I shall await the findings to see if the budget can actually sustain our ambitions.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
