21,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm all set and super excited to see the results! Let's find a winner!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
