23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I'm ready to see the results now. I hope we can find a way to make things easier for everyone.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
